### Endpoints de Perfil de Empresa

# GET - Listar todas las empresas
GET http://localhost:3000/companies

### GET - Obtener perfil de empresa por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/companies/9f85bd2b-e6c5-4aca-97b1-0c6789999307

### POST - Crear perfil de empresa (Autenticado)
POST http://localhost:3000/companies/profile
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Solutions Inc.",
  "industry": "Software Development",
  "website": "https://www.techsolutions.com"
}

### GET - Obtener mi perfil de empresa (Autenticado)
GET http://localhost:3000/companies/profile
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### PUT - Actualizar perfil de empresa (Autenticado)
PUT http://localhost:3000/companies/profile
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Solutions Inc.",
  "industry": "Software Development",
  "website": "https://www.techsolutions.com"
}

### DELETE - Eliminar perfil de empresa (Autenticado)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/companies/profile
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
